--- TS3 (PMF_react_prod/SMD) ---

Steered MD toward the TS3 target along 'dD' (see ../README for the pull parameters). Also
contains its own 'lmp_files/' (seed-structure conversion output) and an empty 'TS2/'
subdirectory with no content -- likely a placeholder for a not-yet-started further stage, not
documented further here. Unlike TS1/, this branch has no corresponding folder under
../../US/ -- not yet carried through to umbrella sampling as of this review.

Three replicas (rep1/2/3) -- one README covers all three.

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
